{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Keep suspension and retry handoff bounded.** This waits for the root handler, including its `finally` blocks, before processing an already-selected `PENDING` or `RETRYING` outcome. A stuck cleanup now repeatedly drives valid waits/retries into Lambda timeout. Bound cleanup using the invocation\u2019s remaining time, reserving time for finalization and response delivery, then force an invocation retry if it cannot finish; add a non-returning-`finally` regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Nuzo","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":126,"observation_digest":"3e5e4407f32b46691a29da44cb7682f1c1316cd90d46f6aba564c9a872c335b4","observation_id":"aro_v1_hzpeib7tfndgsgrj3jcmw5uc6h","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T04:30:54Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gznuwbdoezgdubsa2zuhlunkko","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"880c672b694dd6e9859596872447c03fb779d522","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_f6dsya3fshyhozaawskjxwjwyb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T04:30:54Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
